<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Mediterranean Fury 4, Secure the Flank, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Mediterranean Fury&amp;nbsp;4 – Secure the Flank.&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;16 Feb 1994, 1300 Zulu, 1500 Local&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Three days into World War Three and you as Commander 6&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet are finally able to focus your efforts. It looks like the Turks are solidifying their position on the Bosporus, although it will be a while before the Soviets are finally dealt with; Libya and Algeria have been neutralized, at least for now; it’s been very quit in the Balkans and Aegean Sea; and the sting has been taken out of Syria’s offensive capability. Now it is time to make sure Syria is pummeled into submission! This is a companion to the Northern Fury series and the Northern Fury background document will give you much of the detailed history.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;You are commanding 6&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet, a powerful but diverse force currently gathering in the Eastern Mediterranean Sea. With the assistance of the USAF’s 366&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Expeditionary Air Wing in Egypt, more Turkish forces, Jordanians&amp;nbsp;and another two F-16 Squadrons, you need to start the process of dismantling Syria’s ability to interfere with future operations.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Designer’s Notes:&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;This is the 4th scenario of a campaign, probably of about a dozen scenarios total. See the Northern Fury background document for further insight on the background and happenings so far. The key nuggets&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;UL style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. WP still alive and doing very well.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;The 3rd World war started at 1300hrs Zulu, 13 Feb. The Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union attacked NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow was in Western Europe but fighting erupted throughout Europe, in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for casualties, and achieving tasks given to you.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;The internal disruption in Turkey showcased in Mediterranean Fury 1 has largely been reconciled, but some residual issues remain. The Turkish forces in the south are almost singularly focused on the Syrian frontier and continuing threats from Kurdish insurgents.&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;The global realignment of forces to meet critical threats is ongoing and 6&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet is at the crossroads of that shift. The USS Eisenhower CVBG will need to depart the Med within 72 hours while the USS Nimitz will be arriving from the Indian Ocean in about 96 hours. The loss of HMS Illustrious two days ago was a major blow, and it is likely that HMS Ark Royal will be arriving through the Suez Canal in a few days as well. The Italian carrier ITS Giuseppe Garibaldi is desperately needed in the Adriatic to guard against Serbian or Hungarian activity, you will need to decide on where she and her group are employed.&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; CURSOR: text; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
